  "scope": [
    "Original NPC roots and retained-rank children use own immutable item packets/pierce/seed/path/ordinal,shared prepared chain cell motion and ordered NPC HP with its intrinsic actor stream. Legacy player/Mage/Lightning Strike JSON omits the new context;249shared markers preserve their natural/save/input consumers.",
    "Natural lone/five-hop/failure cases verify exact HP/RNG,per-attempt allocator requests before HP,moved-caster missile origin and retained budget. Missing service refuses before source mutation;invalid restore and copied snapshots retain ownership.",
    "Original partial root and already-created child retain original items/resources/wounds/path/seeds/leases through two real reloads and finish their remaining natural contacts without replay. All380parent retained markers remain."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Allocator callback is an explicit host service at each actual attempt,not a guessed/eager seed list. Its world/game-stream provenance still needs the full item-proc/world binding. Callback side effects belong to the provider;missing/unsupported runtime branches suspend harmlessly rather than fabricating a result.",
    "Current target traversal,NHD identity,return-fire/defense/critical callback order,source removal,nonzero NPC shields and players remain unverified or refused. No original proc registration/history or synchronous item skill frame is enabled.",
    "Compiler-name and fixture-initializer failures are archived. Premature driver1 failed missing-DLL validation before any native server started. AI/A1/startup/initializer/world seed/learned placement/payment/caps/replacement/input/client and final assets remain separate;no class completion or deployment."
  ],
